# Final App Idea

## Smart Budget Tracker

A mobile app that allows users to track their income and expenses, categorize transactions, and monitor their spending. Users can also attach receipt photos for better organization.

This app was selected because it is simple to build, useful in real life, and demonstrates key mobile app features.
